@startuml fig-2-4-ssd-view-explanation
' Figure 2.4 — System sequence diagram, UC-02 View Verdict and Explanation
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Web User" as User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System : openPopup(tabId)
activate System
System --> User : verdictState { verdict, confidencePct, topReasons }
deactivate System

alt analysis previously failed
  User -> System : requestRetry(tabId, url)
  activate System
  System --> User : scanningState
  deactivate System
end

opt user wants the full report
  User -> System : openFullReport(scanId)
  activate System
  System --> User : dashboardUrl(scanId)
  deactivate System
end

note over System
  The popup reads a cached result rather than
  re-issuing an analysis. No snake_case feature
  identifier is ever rendered; every reason has
  passed through the explanation formatter (ADR-010).
end note
@enduml
